     <section class="hero hero-plain"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Legal</p><h1>Privacy.</h1></div></section>
     <section class="sec" style="padding-top:20px"><div class="wrap"><style is:inline>.pv{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;text-align:left}.pv h3{margin:30px 0 10px}.pv p,.pv li{font-size:17px;line-height:1.7}.pv ul{padding-left:20px;margin:0 0 16px}</style><div class="pv"><p><b>Effective October 25, 2026.</b> Vault Human, LLC (&ldquo;Vault Human,&rdquo; &ldquo;we&rdquo;) runs vaulthuman.com and the daily coaching emails. This page says what we collect, why, and what you can ask us to do with it.</p><h3>What we collect</h3><ul><li><b>What you give us.</b> Your name and email when you ask for your first Key or join. Anything you choose to write in a form. If you book a call, the details you enter in Calendly.</li><li><b>Payments.</b> Memberships are paid through Stripe. Stripe handles your card; we never see or store the full card number. We receive your name, email and payment status.</li><li><b>How you use the site.</b> Pages visited, the link or ad that brought you here, device and browser type. We use Google Analytics and the Google Ads tag for this, through cookies.</li><li><b>Email activity.</b> Whether our daily emails arrive, so we can fix delivery problems.</li></ul><h3>Why we use it</h3><ul><li>To send the coaching emails and membership you asked for.</li><li>To answer you, and to book and hold calls.</li><li>To bill memberships and keep payment records.</li><li>To learn which pages and ads help people find us, so we spend less on the ones that don&rsquo;t.</li></ul><h3>What we don&rsquo;t do</h3><ul><li>We don&rsquo;t sell your information.</li><li>We don&rsquo;t share what you tell us in coaching with advertisers.</li><li>Vault Human is coaching, not therapy or medical care. Don&rsquo;t send us health records.</li></ul><h3>Who helps us run it</h3><p>These companies process data for us under their own privacy terms: HubSpot (contacts), Google (Analytics, Ads, Gmail), Stripe (payments), Calendly (scheduling), Cloudflare (website hosting).</p><h3>Cookies and ads</h3><p>Google Analytics and Google Ads set cookies to measure visits and ad results. You can block cookies in your browser. You can opt out of Google&rsquo;s ad personalization at <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">adssettings.google.com</a>.</p><h3>Your choices</h3><ul><li>Every email has an unsubscribe link.</li><li>Write to <a href="mailto:vault@vaulthuman.com">vault@vaulthuman.com</a> to see, correct or delete what we hold about you. We answer within 30 days.</li><li>We keep payment records as long as tax law requires, and everything else only as long as you&rsquo;re a member or on the list.</li></ul><h3>Children</h3><p>The site and the program are for adults. We don&rsquo;t knowingly collect information from anyone under 18.</p><h3>Changes</h3><p>If this policy changes, we update the date at the top and note what changed.</p><h3>Contact</h3><p>Vault Human, LLC &middot; 1401 Lavaca St #211, Austin, Texas 78701 &middot; <a href="mailto:vault@vaulthuman.com">vault@vaulthuman.com</a> &middot; <a href="tel:+18888332510">(888) 833-2510</a></p></div></div></section>
